  "coverage": "Extensible speech-function inventory v1; not an exhaustive universal language or automatic parser.",
  "provenance": {
    "entries": "New authored semantic entries, grounded in UD and existing conlang roles; English forms are sense examples, not native translations.",
    "course": "User-provided ENGL&101 Content Words Vs Function Words Exercises. Original generated lessons; no assignment answers.",
